#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Pill by Pill v6.2t Patch: Quiz Expansion Batch 3 (80 -> 100 Questions) & Glossary Expansion (60 -> 80 Terms).

Completes full quiz & acronym glossary coverage across the merged v6.2 stack (History/Laws, AMR,
Shortages, BD/M&A/rNPV, Radiopharma/21 CFR 212, ADCs, BIMO/CDISC, ICH Q13/Q14, NAMs/FDAMA 2.0,
BCS M9, DMFs, Nitrosamines/NDSRIs, Project Optimus, and HCT/P 361 vs. 351):
  1. Appends 20 primary-sourced questions to `pipeline/quiz_extra.json` (80 -> 100 total, idempotent).
  2. Appends 20 essential acronyms to `pipeline/build_v61b_reference.py` (60 -> 80 terms total, idempotent).

Usage:
  python3 2026-11-24_v6.2t_quiz100_and_glossary80_expansion_patch.py --selftest
  python3 2026-11-24_v6.2t_quiz100_and_glossary80_expansion_patch.py --apply /path/to/unpacked_source
"""
